, especially following future civic reworks. See for details with screenshots and such [KI#76](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs_And_Appendixes/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#76---tremendously-improved-ais-almost-always-picking-civic_caste_system-and-then-almost-never-changing-it-no-matter-what-unlimited-specialists-logic-favoured-only-culture-as-well-and-much-needed-an-improvement-and-generalization-in-cvplayeraiai_civicvalue).
