-- (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5135+) Implemented preferrential master<->vassal(s) tech trading (we are heavily more willing to tech trade with our master/vassal(s)), in `CvPlayerAI::AI_doDiplo`. This synergises the previous devalue techs we can get from our master/vassal(s) change (see [Technologies (AI)](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs_And_Appendixes/README_Custom_Main_Changes_Guide.md#technologies-ai)) and expands on it, not just techs that overlap with what our master/vassal(s) already know. In autoplay, this seemingly leads to better tech sharing between vassal(s) and their master (a vassal was mostly way ahead in tech and now the master has more techs). Added a second parameter to `AI_contactRoll(CONTACT_TRADE_TECH` (was using a default of 1 in the header file anyways etc.) so that tech trading is now more dynamic and not passively based only on personality anyways etc. See for details [KI#78](/_1_AdvCiv-SAS/Docs_And_Appendixes/README_Known_Issues_In_Base_AdvCiv_Civ4.md#78---improved-trade-techs-preferentially-with-our-vassals-or-master-synergises-with-the-no-overlap-previous-master-vassals-tweak--add-a-second-parameter-now-ai_contactrollcontact_trade_tech-rcontactprobmult-to-have-a-more-dynamic-tech-trading-not-only-based-on-personality-according-to-chatgpt-51-and-then-corrected-by-claude-sonnet-45s-review-check-if-accurate-anyways-etc). (Requires AdvCiv-SAS 5138+) Update: also added vassal<->vassal siblings extra tech trading chance similarly, which leads in autoplay (since Ewuare has 2 vassals at t250) to seemingly more or less identical results, which is fine as long as not clearly harmful, and this only boosts chance, not reduces trade which may be less predictable in terms of is this beneficial or harmful.
